OL,3,GNEWSAGo ahead for new crematorium could
OL,4,Areduce 'rush' for bereaved families
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second crematorium in east Belfast
OL,7,Fhas been given the green light in a
OL,8,Fmove which one funeral director said
OL,9,Fcould "make everything less rushed" for
OL,10,Fgrieving families.
OL,12,FPlans for a new crematorium at Roselawn
OL,13,FCemetery were unveiled by Belfast City
OL,14,FCouncil (BCC) in 2021 but had faced
OL,15,Fdelays.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
