OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGo ahead for new crematorium could
OL,4,Areduce 'rush' for bereaved families
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this week, the council voted to
OL,7,Freject a Sinn Fein proposal to build a
OL,8,Fcrematorium at Milltown in west
OL,9,FBelfast. Votes from Alliance, the
OL,10,Funionist parties and the Green Party
OL,11,Fpushed through a decision to progress a
OL,12,Fnew two-chapel crematorium at Roselawn.
OL,14,F"The need for another crematorium has
OL,15,Fbeen obvious for a long time," said
OL,16,FStephen Larkin, past president of the
OL,17,FAssociation of Funeral Directors.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
